# Architecture plan TODO discipline

When working on tasks from [plan/](../plan/):

## On task completion (required)

1. Update [plan/TODO.md](../plan/TODO.md):
   - Change `- [ ]` to `- [x]` for the task ID (e.g. `P1-T03`, `P5-QWEN-12`, `P7-CHAOS-lease-expiry`).
   - Refresh the **Summary** table counts (Done / In Progress / Blocked).
   - Set **Last updated** to today's date (ISO `YYYY-MM-DD`).
   - Add a one-line evidence note if applicable (commit hash, test path, artifact under `artifacts/` or `evidence/`).

2. Update the matching task block in [plan/phases/](../plan/phases/):
   - Set **Status:** to `done` (or `blocked` / `in_progress` as appropriate).
   - Fill **Evidence** with concrete paths — never leave vague.

3. If the task closes a [plan/closure-checklist.md](../plan/closure-checklist.md) item, check that box only when evidence meets Section 66 (`IMPLEMENTED_PRODUCTION`).

4. Update [plan/audit-matrix.md](../plan/audit-matrix.md) when the task changes feature classification.

## Done definition (Section 66)

Never mark a task complete without evidence in: Source, SQL, Contracts, DSL, Events, Tests, Production Path — or an explicit gap classification (`MISSING`, `PARTIAL`, etc.) documented in audit-matrix.

## Constraints

- Do not contradict [docs/EDGE-MINT-TARGET-ARCHITECTURE-v2.md](../docs/EDGE-MINT-TARGET-ARCHITECTURE-v2.md) (frozen v2). Further revisions require v3+.
- Respect phase dependencies in phase files; do not skip phases without documented dependency overrides.
- [cursor/work-packages.json](../cursor/work-packages.json) remains the implementation DAG; note WP cross-refs in phase task blocks when relevant.
- Forbidden worker components (Section 2.3) must never be introduced: `LocalTaskSelector`, `LocalRetryOrchestrator`, `LocalReassignmentManager`, `LocalCloudFallbackDecision`.

## When starting a task

- Set **Status:** to `in_progress` in the phase file.
- Optionally note `in_progress` in TODO summary table for that phase.
